{"id":"n61278-1-7","stage":4,"title":"뻘뻘 · (汗水)淋漓","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61278-1-7-1","ko":"넌 떡볶이 먹으면서 웬 땀을 그렇게 뻘뻘 흘려?","zh":"你吃炒年糕怎么会流这么多汗啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"떡볶이","meaning":"辣炒年糕","explanation":"떡볶이：辣炒年糕","readings":[{"term":"떡볶이","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15180","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡볶이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떡볶이","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으면서","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으면서","audio":"/audio/95266ba2517f75a194bb.mp3"}},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}},{"text":"땀을","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땀을","audio":"/audio/cf0c748e4dc40e60964b.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"뻘뻘","meaning":"(汗水)淋漓，涔涔","explanation":"뻘뻘：(汗水)淋漓，涔涔","readings":[{"term":"뻘뻘","audio":"/audio/bd79939d83a8002c278f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61278","senseId":"1","lemma":"뻘뻘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뻘뻘","audio":"/audio/bd79939d83a8002c278f.mp3"}},{"text":"흘려?","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘려","audio":"/audio/18e0bdd2846e22b4e66e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"694b11f55ee86234","term":"떡볶이","zh":"辣炒年糕","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3","entryId":"15180","definition":"将长条年糕切成适当大小，加入酱油或辣椒酱等调料和各种蔬菜一同炒熟的食物。","pronunciation":["떡뽀끼"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"bd79939d83a8002c","term":"뻘뻘","zh":"(汗水)淋漓，涔涔","audio":"/audio/bd79939d83a8002c278f.mp3","entryId":"61278","definition":"流了很多汗的样子。","pronunciation":["뻘뻘"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":